- costing sheet lines with how-text, overheads, margin, typed price, tax, other quantities
- incomplete costing blocks 'quoted' unless a manager accepts with a reason; quotation PDF
- regression tests: Model Town 428.80 per copy, Zameen 224.89 per copy; upgrade from 19.0.1.1.1 rehearsed
- pp_print_sale: Create sales order from a quoted estimate (no stored field on sale.order)
