-Tested on Odoo 19: 25 unit tests in this module, 1 in `pp_print_sale` (`--test-tags=pp_print_core`), including the
+Tested on Odoo 19: 29 unit tests in this module, 1 in `pp_print_sale` (`--test-tags=pp_print_core`), including the
